{"sha": "1e1822ff7d66d32abde5b6d22215c59501a8ace09c79a205434b3470f5a1d6b5", "body": ["\\section{铁磁性的应用：磁畴与磁滞}", "", "\\begin{definition}[磁畴与磁滞]\\label{def:b3:electromagnetism-in-matter:hysteresis}", "\\index{磁畴}\\index{磁滞}\\index{剩磁}\\index{矫顽场}", "原始的铁块\\emph{并未}磁化：它碎裂成", "\\emph{磁畴}，即微米尺度的区域，每个区域内部充分磁化，", "但指向各异，因而外部场（及其能量代价）", "几乎相互抵消。外加 $\\vect H$ 使磁畴壁移动——", "有利取向的磁畴增长——随后使整块磁畴转动，", "排列一致。磁畴壁会被缺陷钉住，因而过程不可逆：令", "$H$ 上下往复变化时，$B(H)$ 描出一条回线，即\\emph{磁滞", "回线}。切断电流后，仍有\\emph{剩磁}场", "$B_{\\text{r}}$ 保留；要使之归零，需加反向的", "\\emph{矫顽场}$H_{\\text{c}}$。回线所围面积即", "每个循环、单位体积耗散的能量。\\emph{软磁}", "材料（硅钢、铁氧体：回线窄，", "$H_{\\text{c}}$ 小）用于制作变压器与电动机铁芯；\\emph{硬磁}", "材料（铝镍钴、Nd$_2$Fe$_{14}$B：回线宽，$H_{\\text{c}}$ 极大）用于制成", "永磁体，也用于磁存储：冰箱磁铁", "与硬盘都是“不肯遗忘”的磁滞回线。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  % left: demagnetized domains", "  \\begin{scope}", "    \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (3.2,2.4);", "    \\draw (1.1,0) -- (1.4,2.4);", "    \\draw (2.2,0) -- (1.9,2.4);", "    \\draw (0,1.3) -- (1.25,1.15);", "    \\draw (2.05,1.2) -- (3.2,1.0);", "    \\draw[->, omDef, thick] (0.45,0.4) -- (0.85,1.0);", "    \\draw[->, omDef, thick] (1.75,1.9) -- (1.35,1.6);", "    \\draw[->, omDef, thick] (1.55,0.35) -- (1.85,0.85);", "    \\draw[->, omDef, thick] (0.4,2.0) -- (0.9,1.75);", "    \\draw[->, omDef, thick] (2.75,1.9) -- (2.45,1.35);", "    \\draw[->, omDef, thick] (2.5,0.4) -- (2.9,0.7);", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north] at (1.6,-0.15)", "      {$H = 0$：磁畴相互抵消};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % right: aligned", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=5.4cm]", "    \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (3.2,2.4);", "    \\foreach \\y in {0.5,1.2,1.9}", "      {\\draw[->, omThm, thick] (0.4,\\y) -- (1.4,\\y);", "       \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (1.8,\\y) -- (2.8,\\y);}", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north] at (1.6,-0.15)", "      {$H$ 较强：单一磁畴};", "    \\draw[->, thick] (-1.5,1.2) -- (-0.5,1.2)", "      node[midway, above, font=\\scriptsize] {$\\vect H$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 磁畴。左：原始的铁磁体把磁化隐藏于", "相互抵消的区域中。右：外加场增强，并", "使磁畴转动，形成单一磁化的整体——经由不可逆的", "畴壁跳跃，赋予铁以“记忆”。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "    width=9.6cm, height=6.4cm, xmin=-3.4, xmax=3.4, ymin=-1.5, ymax=1.5,", "    axis lines=middle,", "    xlabel={$H$}, ylabel={$B$},", "    xtick=\\empty, ytick=\\empty, clip=false]", "    % descending branch (upper): from +sat to -sat", "    \\addplot[omThm, very thick, domain=-3:3, samples=150]", "      {tanh(1.4*(x+0.8))};", "    % ascending branch (lower)", "    \\addplot[omThm, very thick, domain=-3:3, samples=150]", "      {tanh(1.4*(x-0.8))};", "    % initial magnetization curve", "    \\addplot[omDef, dashed, thick, domain=0:3, samples=100]", "      {tanh(1.05*x)};", "    % arrows indicating traversal", "    \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (axis cs:-0.1,0.752) -- (axis cs:-0.35,0.65);", "    \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (axis cs:0.1,-0.752) -- (axis cs:0.35,-0.65);", "    % remanence and coercivity", "    \\fill (axis cs:0,0.807) circle (1.5pt);", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south west] at (axis cs:0.08,0.84)", "      {$B_{\\text{r}}$};", "    \\fill (axis cs:-0.8,0) circle (1.5pt);", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north east] at (axis cs:-0.85,-0.07)", "      {$-H_{\\text{c}}$};", "    \\node[omDef, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north west] at (axis cs:1.15,0.62)", "      {首次磁化};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:3.05,0.997)", "      {饱和};", "  \\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 磁滞回线。从原始态（虚线）出发，", "场使 $B$ 达到饱和；$H$ 回到零时留下", "剩磁 $B_{\\text{r}}$，只有矫顽场", "$-H_{\\text{c}}$ 才能将其抹除。回线面积即每循环、单位", "体积的热量：变压器用窄回线，永", "磁体用宽回线。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[铁芯电磁铁]\\label{ex:b3:electromagnetism-in-matter:electromagnet}", "在铁环上绕 $N$ 匝通有电流 $I$ 的线圈，铁环的 $\\mu_{\\text{r}}", "\\sim 5000$），环上带有小气隙 $e$。对沿回路的 $\\vect H$ 用", "安培环路定理：$H_{\\text{iron}}\\ell + H_{\\text{gap}}e = NI$，", "且磁通连续，$B$ 处处相同，因此", "\\[", "B\\Big(\\frac{\\ell}{\\mu_0\\mu_{\\text{r}}} + \\frac{e}{\\mu_0}\\Big) = NI .", "\\]", "取 $\\ell = \\qty{1}{m}$，$e = \\qty{1}{cm}$，则气隙项为", "铁芯项的五十倍：线圈几乎全部的努力都用于", "把磁场推过一厘米的空气。这便是磁路的要点：铁是近乎", "完美的磁通导体，空气则相当于“电阻器”，", "因而电动机、继电器和废料场起重磁铁", "都力求把气隙做得尽可能薄", "（见\\cref{pb:b3:electromagnetism-in-matter:1}）。", "\\end{example}", ""]}